 "name_en": "Event-Based Revenue Recognition – Sell from Stock – IFRS (33M)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Event-Based Revenue Recognition – Sell from Stock – IFRS (33M)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioef2f30435bb44f01a6b8e58d07388da3\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioef2f30435bb44f01a6b8e58d07388da3__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Event-based Revenue Recognition calculates and posts real-time revenue and cost adjustment for sales orders, using parallel ledger functionality. When a goods issue is posted for sale from stock, revenue is calculated based on quantity, accrued revenue is posted, and costs are matched to revenues.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Processes that do not write a source document do not result in real-time revenue recognition postings. For example, changes of plan data do not directly result in revenue recognition postings. Period-end closing postings (periodic revenue recognition) correct the event-based postings. After period-end closing, the posted values are fully correct and separate settlement is no longer required.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioef2f30435bb44f01a6b8e58d07388da3__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor event-based revenue recognition for sales order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage real-time revenue recognition issues</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Run revenue recognition for sales orders in period-end closing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage revenue recognition issues for sales orders</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Report sales order actuals</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioef2f30435bb44f01a6b8e58d07388da3__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Change the underlying method of revenue recognition significantly (available in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Adjust for imminent loss, anticipated sales deductions, and unrealized costs</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Run a simulation to view important sales order KPIs via semantic tags</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Get correct posted values after period-end closing with no separate settlement required</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>基于事件的收入确认 – 现货销售 – IFRS (33M)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioef2f30435bb44f01a6b8e58d07388da3\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioef2f30435bb44f01a6b8e58d07388da3__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">基于事件的收入确认使用并行分类账功能计算和过账销售订单的实时收入和成本调整。为从库存销售过账发货时，将根据数量计算收入，过账应计收入，并将成本与收入进行匹配。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">不写入源凭证的流程不会导致实时收入确认过账。例如，计划数据的更改不会直接导致收入确认过账。期末关账过账（定期收入确认）会更正基于事件的过账。期末关账后，过账值完全正确，不再需要单独结算。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioef2f30435bb44f01a6b8e58d07388da3__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">监控销售订单的基于事件的收入确认</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理实时收入确认问题</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在期末关账时运行销售订单的收入确认</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理销售订单的收入确认问题</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">报告销售订单实际值</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioef2f30435bb44f01a6b8e58d07388da3__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">显著更改收入确认的基础方法（在 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中可用）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">调整迫近损失、预期销售扣减和未实现成本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">运行模拟，通过语义标记查看重要的销售订单 KPI</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">期末关账后获取正确的过账值，无需单独结算</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
